Replaces: omr-server
Description: OpenMPTCProuter Server script
 Server side of OpenMPTCProuter: installation script, systemd units, nftables
 ruleset and tunnel configuration files, shipped in /usr/share/omr-server and
 re-applied by omr-update. The versioned dependencies match the package
 versions the installer (debian9-x86_64.sh) itself asks apt for, so installing
 this package pins a VPS to a known set of tunnel binaries.
